{"title": "Spark Blocker", "pageid": 28576, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Spark_Blocker", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Spark Blocker</b> is a passive feature that prevents the wearer from being electrocuted.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>The wearer can't be <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Electrocuted_(Condition)\" title=\"Electrocuted (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cd/Electrocuted_Condition_Icon.webp/26px-Electrocuted_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cd/Electrocuted_Condition_Icon.webp/39px-Electrocuted_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cd/Electrocuted_Condition_Icon.webp/52px-Electrocuted_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Electrocuted\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cd/Electrocuted_Condition_Icon.webp/26px-Electrocuted_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"26\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cd/Electrocuted_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Electrocuted_(Condition)\" title=\"Electrocuted (Condition)\">Electrocuted</a>. \n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Details\"> Details </span></h3>\n<dl class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dd><details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">MAG_ChargedLightning_Resistance_Ring_Passive</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_ChargedLightning_Resistance_Ring_Passive\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"